WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.960
Speaker 1: [gentle music]

2
00:00:02.960 --> 00:00:24.980
Speaker 1: [wind blowing]

3
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.540
Speaker 2: Yes. Wait until you see it.

4
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:37.080
Speaker 3: [footsteps crunching]

5
00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.780
Speaker 3: Is it supposed to be on fire?

6
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:47.280
Speaker 2: [dramatic music]

7
00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.320
Speaker 2: Oh, no.

8
00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:48.980
Speaker 3: Hmm. I like it.

9
00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:53.580
Speaker 4: [fire roaring] Ho, ho.

10
00:00:58.900 --> 00:00:58.980
Speaker 4: Oh. Oh.

11
00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:00.300
Speaker 3: That's a lot of red.

12
00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:07.300
Speaker 4: You, snowman. The gun. Grab my gun.

13
00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:07.580
Speaker 2: Heh.

14
00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:12.140
Speaker 4: Don't you know who that is? Shoot
him, you fool.

15
00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:17.000
Speaker 5: [gun cocking] Go ahead, shoot me.

16
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:21.780
Speaker 5: [footsteps crunching] You don't have
the

17
00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.380
Speaker 5: snowballs.

18
00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.380
Speaker 5: [wind blowing] [dramatic music] Give
me that.

19
00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:41.940
Speaker 5: [gun creaking]

20
00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:42.120
Speaker 5: [laser buzzing]

21
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:42.141
Speaker 4: Oh. Oh.

22
00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:45.940
Speaker 5: You were always weaker, Nicholas.

23
00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:49.820
Speaker 5: I just didn't want the job.

24
00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:55.900
Speaker 2: Please. I was nice this year. I was
nice.

25
00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:02.100
Speaker 5: I don't care. [footsteps crunching]

26
00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:08.479
Speaker 5: Onslasher. Onkiller. Onchiller.
Ongristle.

27
00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:13.500
Speaker 5: [monsters growling] Mm, the rest of
you don't get names.

28
00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:16.140
Speaker 5: [whip cracking] Fly, or your name is
dinner.

29
00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:24.920
Speaker 5: [monsters growling]

30
00:02:24.980 --> 00:02:27.100
Speaker 3: Wow, you screwed up.

31
00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:33.480
Speaker 2: [footsteps crunching] [metal
clanging] Do you think you'd still hire me?

32
00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.480
Speaker 3: [laughs]

33
00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:58.900
Speaker 1: [wind blowing] [upbeat music]
